   "text": "Layout only, no colors. Each frame is the level screen at 1280 × 720 (the smallest window), paused at line 5 so that every block shows.\nPick one (or mix two); the large screen (1920 × 1080) comes once the layout is chosen. Double-click a block to edit it, Ctrl+Shift+G to ungroup.",
